    "content": "RETENTION v-next (F21, 2026-11-16). Implements the F14 privacy decision (owner-approved 2026-11-16): people data basis = legitimate interest, B2B public sources only; retention = 12 months from fetch/creation (people.retention_until). CONFIG mode = anonymise: due rows lose full_name, linkedin_url, email, email_status, raw_payload; company link, title and evidence quote stay for aggregate reporting. Runs monthly (1st, 03:00 Bangkok); manual test runs use the editor execute or a pinned test run. Alert is a Gmail DRAFT only - this workflow never sends. No person data is ever written to any Sheet by this workflow.",
